%% Supplier product and catalog flow
%% Status: current | Related: apps/api/src/routes/products.routes.js
flowchart LR
  Supplier[Supplier tenant] --> CRUD[POST/PATCH /api/products]
  CRUD --> Limit[checkLimit supplier_products_skus]
  Limit --> Product[product + supplier_product rows]
  Product --> Price[prices / restaurant-pricing overrides]
  Product --> Inv[supplier inventory stock]
  Restaurant[Restaurant] --> Browse[GET catalog from linked suppliers]
  Browse --> Cart[Add to cart at negotiated or list price]
